@startuml
title Frontend - React y Vite cumplen roles distintos

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #16a34a
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #1e3a5f
  FontColor #334155
}

component "React\nUI y componentes" as react
component "Vite\nDev server + build" as vite
component "App web\nEcoBrief Bolivia" as app

react --> app : construye pantallas
vite --> app : compila y sirve

note bottom of react
Home, Noticias,
Datos, Impacto,
Suscripcion
end note

note bottom of vite
TypeScript, CSS,
assets y bundle
end note

@enduml
